# In Search of Practical Applications: A Public Services Research Agenda for University Libraries.

**Authors:** Dewey, Barbara I.

## Abstract
Reviews selected research studies with practical application to university library service models and offers suggestions for a research agenda supporting the advancement of strategic services. Discusses information-seeking behavior; user education, information literacy, and learning technologies; scholarly communication and the digital library; user/librarian interaction; and management issues. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ555864

